c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ Knuth's man or boy test, as he wrote it (the x unspecified), for k
from 0 to 12. k = 12 needs about 1 MB of stack;
b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲
    r̲e̲a̲l̲ p̲r̲o̲c̲e̲d̲u̲r̲e̲ A(k, x1, x2, x3, x4, x5); v̲a̲l̲u̲e̲ k; i̲n̲t̲e̲g̲e̲r̲ k;
    b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲
        r̲e̲a̲l̲ p̲r̲o̲c̲e̲d̲u̲r̲e̲ B;
        b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲ k := k - 1; B := A := A(k, B, x1, x2, x3, x4) e̲n̲d̲;
        i̲f̲ k ≤ 0 t̲h̲e̲n̲ A := x4 + x5 e̲l̲s̲e̲ B
    e̲n̲d̲;
    i̲n̲t̲e̲g̲e̲r̲ k;
    f̲o̲r̲ k := 0 s̲t̲e̲p̲ 1 u̲n̲t̲i̲l̲ 12 d̲o̲ outreal(1, A(k, 1, -1, -1, 1, 0))
e̲n̲d̲
